{"author_follower": 7463280, "author_like": 69796400, "author_video": 525, "comment_num": 47211, "comments": {"6999599119820161826": {"comments": "[泣不成声]考试不会因为这事儿降低难度，也不会因为这个增加录取率……", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 7379, "comments_reply": 5, "comments_time": 1629721169}, "6999599510720742155": {"comments": "看完了，怎么样才能让全中国的家长看到这个视频[看]", "comments_is_author_like": true, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 12426, "comments_reply": 6, "comments_time": 1629721261}, "6999599895070130947": {"comments": "自从看了你，相亲相爱一家人已经把我踢出并拉黑了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 1929, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1629721350}, "6999606568245789452": {"comments": "很有道理，但我感觉作者漏掉了一点，就是地区间的教育资源差异，三四线的小城市老师月薪也就三四千，大城市的轻松上万，可是网课，确实能让三四线的孩子享受到大城市的教育资源[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 4002, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1629722905}, "6999608868120724264": {"comments": "家长始终不明白 你孩子和富人孩子的差距不是培训和学习 仅仅是家长自己而已[黑脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 2890, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1629723439}, "6999608916510655273": {"comments": "我觉得你说的也不全面。其实有好多孩子虽然听不明白课堂老师讲，却能通过培训学习理解知识。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 840, "comments_reply": 3, "comments_time": 1629723450}, "6999648896041370368": {"comments": "不是替老师说话，就是觉得老师工资太低了，普通的三四千，好点的1万，但是付出的确实挺多，大环境让他们想赚外快，收红包，区别对待", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 809, "comments_reply": 2, "comments_time": 1629732759}, "6999838177591264000": {"comments": "我之前是校外机构的老师，孩子的优秀大多数就是家长用钱砸出来的，改变不了的事实[看]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 37, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1629776830}, "6999939163856487200": {"comments": "这个视频基本上没有歪曲事实，但是，他有目的地回避了很多基本事实不谈。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 54, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1629800344}, "6999976965751571200": {"comments": "前面几个举例太极端，报培训班的并没有这么多顶级富豪家长，就算有，别人也不屑培训了。孩子以后路子很多，不一定要通过文化实现。另外，普通家庭孩子参加培训，并不一定没用，总有在培训中进步，也有没进步的学生", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 89, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1629809144}, "7000972920466441000": {"comments": "落实到实际情况，能参加校外补习班的无非两种孩子，一种是本身不错希望精益求精，一种是真的很笨，笨到你哭泣。还有小地方的优秀老师，都被高阶的学校挖走了[暗中观察]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 14, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1630041033}, "7020784470484042500": {"comments": "校内老师确实教不够，我孩子有个问题不太了解，问老师，老师只用“可以的”三个字给打发了，我只能问培训班的老师，人家就讲解的很详细，还举例说明。差别非常大！", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 19, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1634653770}, "7025830020229088000": {"comments": "很多人也没有想过要跟富家子弟比，只要比同阶层的人跑得快一点就行。[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 31, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1635828527}, "7170973009045635879": {"comments": "[赞][赞][赞]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1669622270}, "7172083689903866658": {"comments": "那是不是让孩子学会了更多的知识，本就是买卖[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1669880874}, "7172609266847073024": {"comments": "校内老师照样补课啊[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1670003283}, "7172655482028327718": {"comments": "其实不是学校老师教得不好，学得不够才去补课，是自己娃儿学得不好，吸收慢，笨才去补课，学校一个班的娃儿同样的老师，都不补课的情况下会有成绩的差异，娃儿没别人家的聪明，没有别人家勤奋，那就只有通过补课来提高，没有家长希望看着自己的娃就这样，差就差下去", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 6, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1670014057}, "7173576995787375360": {"comments": "改变孩子的世界观和价值观是关键，教育从娃娃抓起", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1670228561}, "7174275096118575904": {"comments": "内卷太严重了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1670391099}, "7176448883253461775": {"comments": "现在是鼓励用学习终端机自主学习的", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1670897224}, "7177864924452881192": {"comments": "补课的学生大多数是资质不强，没认真学，学校老师教学能力不够，所以只能补课，双不双减对这些学生没有区别", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1671226943}, "7177984676639343412": {"comments": "这才是真正的快乐教育[黑脸]快乐教育不是说每天休息多长时间，也不是孩子们童年过得多白痴无语无压力[黑脸]真正的快乐教育叫予乐于教[黑脸]你能让孩子们对学习这件事充满快乐，让学习不再是无聊的负担而不是盲目减压[黑脸]你要整顿教育而不是抽薪止火", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 6, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1671254800}, "7180889914547651368": {"comments": "支持", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1671931234}, "7193223941991875339": {"comments": "[赞][赞][赞]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1674802968}, "7194741000484963130": {"comments": "没了培训就不能翻身了吗[送心]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1675156189}, "7194786528726369058": {"comments": "高考的分永远都不会减", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1675166782}, "7202698575246377787": {"comments": "那我自己在家给孩子培训可不可以？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1677009012}, "7203856734992253733": {"comments": "他们都会背着你们做题至于我为什么知道我就是学生，你猜我为什么知道\n他们不可能会遵守他们都会背着你们", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1677278614}, "7204872109619905338": {"comments": "所以还得补，越减越得补", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1677515027}, "7209474161084433185": {"comments": "校外培训就从来没停过", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1678586518}, "7209520737224344354": {"comments": "问题是、优秀的老师回归了吗？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1678597365}, "7216707313347379983": {"comments": "我问一下大家啊，双减政策大多数为好处，那弊处有哪些，知道的都回一下，我需要这样的文章[流泪][流泪]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1680270615}, "7218539166719083299": {"comments": "你以为这样就没有校外培训了么？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1680697126}, "7222885040966976315": {"comments": "问题是校外培训一直在。打击了一个月就没了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1681708985}, "7255158855854883643": {"comments": "不会有人真认为补课能提高成绩吧，读书就是基因问题", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1689223313}, "7260842857904374528": {"comments": "放假了谁看孩子，你先说说谁给看孩子，家长带薪放暑假？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1690546728}, "7263659023634694970": {"comments": "66", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1691202418}, "7269585578499638031": {"comments": "6666", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1692582303}, "7276284668130820899": {"comments": "666", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1694142061}, "7284538190924219173": {"comments": "你第一句花就是错的，当你认为80%家长的意识都有问题时，已经远离了客观实际", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1696063730}}, "controversy": 1, "crawl_time": 1701064896.2392144, "custom_verify": "财经自媒体", "enterprise_verify_reason": "", "forward_num": 70196, "is_modified": 1, "keywords": "双减政策", "like_num": 387071, "publish_time": 1629720617, "star_num": 11438, "title": "没了校外培训，普通人的孩子该怎么翻身？#双减 ", "url": "https://www.douyin.com/aweme/v1/play/?video_id=v0300fg10000c4hofp3c77u58n8kuqg0", "video_id": "6999587842078870791", "video_length": 265.96}
{"author_follower": 27215, "author_like": 179534, "author_video": 101, "comment_num": 1906, "comments": {"7297794632627323698": {"comments": "这次家长就不要骂作业多了，愿意写的可以多写，不愿意写的可以不写，再在网络上骂作业多就是混蛋了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 445, "comments_reply": 10, "comments_time": 1699150225}, "7297822898151392015": {"comments": "我觉得挺好啊，这种熔断机制", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 610, "comments_reply": 18, "comments_time": 1699156807}, "7297861526680421161": {"comments": "熔断机制可以升级一个学校一分为二，选择熔断的，一个校区，不熔断的，另一个校区！熔断校区，全面素质教育，体育美术音乐劳动政治课是主课，其他都是副科，且平时不考试，只在中考高考考试！", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 46, "comments_reply": 14, "comments_time": 1699165800}, "7297978024686142208": {"comments": "但是很多家长，不会签这个字，嘴上说着作业要写，老师要管，可老师一旦管了，就又要批判老师[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 524, "comments_reply": 5, "comments_time": 1699192924}, "7298213615726560054": {"comments": "为什么学校不把这种家长的孩子单独收一个班，让其他孩子该玩就玩呢？说白了还是学校就没想解决问题[捂脸][捂脸][捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 5, "comments_reply": 20, "comments_time": 1699247778}, "7298423867957248831": {"comments": "我觉得别光作业了，考试也应该熔断。以后学校也分一下最好，国家别一棒子打死，应该放宽政策，学校分类，分快乐教育和内卷教育。这样就好了。我还是希望我家孩子能多努力点，毕竟家庭条件不好。那些家里条件好的，去上快乐教育的就好[捂脸][捂脸][捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 87, "comments_reply": 12, "comments_time": 1699296768}, "7298495944956592933": {"comments": "我是老师，我支持作业熔断", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 798, "comments_reply": 14, "comments_time": 1699313514}, "7298882914590671670": {"comments": "挺好，作为一个小学老师问下，什么时候执行？！不想追着学生屁股后面要作业了，还要跟家长联系，太累了[泣不成声]还招人记恨[发怒]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 43, "comments_reply": 8, "comments_time": 1699403616}, "7298888997811389238": {"comments": "熔断是不可能熔断的，很多家长卷是想卷，但是想让老师全权负责（别问我怎么知道的[苦涩]）", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 240, "comments_reply": 5, "comments_time": 1699405029}, "7299076899245998888": {"comments": "作为数学老师加班主任，我来分享一下作业是怎么被学生和家长自己熔断的。刚开学的时候学生经常不交作业，刚开始老师会想办法教育学生，让学生补，各种收拾，联系家长。但是一段时间后还是没作用，学生依然不写，或者乱写。慢慢家长也不管了，老师自然而然也不管了。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 25, "comments_reply": 7, "comments_time": 1699448776}, "7299111562148545306": {"comments": "我真的不明白，为什么教育总是跟随家长的意愿，家长要延时就延时，家长一告状就处理老师或赔偿………", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 144, "comments_reply": 4, "comments_time": 1699456848}, "7299149233927226164": {"comments": "有的家长连签熔断字都不愿意签，主打个啥责任也不担", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 51, "comments_reply": 7, "comments_time": 1699465640}, "7299231126009905958": {"comments": "别只作业熔断，上学也可以，毕竟有些孩子真的不适合学习[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 49, "comments_reply": 4, "comments_time": 1699484687}, "7299275765344928538": {"comments": "这个熔断就和医生的手续前的家属签字一个道理,什么都需要家长来做,要老师到底做什么?", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 6, "comments_reply": 20, "comments_time": 1699500202}, "7299281570878882575": {"comments": "挺好的，我一直觉得应该将大学模式推广到小初高，老师只要负责把每节课打造好，想学不想学，靠个人意愿。，每个人都有选择的权利。为什么要像现在一样逼着人学？ 反正我身为一个高中老师，我无法理解现在的教育", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 23, "comments_reply": 3, "comments_time": 1699496432}, "7299314396034237218": {"comments": "作业熔断了，建议取消用成绩考核中小学教师", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 454, "comments_reply": 9, "comments_time": 1699504073}, "7299402320796943139": {"comments": "教师也要有熔断机制，只要老师教到一定程度某个孩子任然无动于衷，那么就可以不用把这个孩子的成绩算到班级成绩里了[看]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 129, "comments_reply": 4, "comments_time": 1699524544}, "7303144598666511114": {"comments": "因为大部分家长在家鸡娃，人为造成了许多高分，所以考试为了体现筛选功能，只能越来越难。当后面的家长发现时为时已晚。当然这也和人口数量增长有关。教材越来越难，学的越来越多。这就是内卷。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1700395861}, "7303175311076147968": {"comments": "认同！", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700403014}, "7303183307993989940": {"comments": "其实老师和学生就是一个活生生的对比，学生小，不能用成绩来评价，老师是成年人，学生的成绩是判定老师的唯一标准。从小没受过挫折，长大了突然遭遇，他们真的有那个承受能力不崩溃吗？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700404874}, "7303334823728710426": {"comments": "时间熔断太不科学了，应该作业量熔断", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700440156}, "7303345673230893851": {"comments": "早就该熔断了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700442681}, "7303485119478088489": {"comments": "所以以后，学校学区会更重要，因为氛围好。差的学校氛围不好，你自己都会渐渐被带的懒散了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1700475146}, "7303532094302929675": {"comments": "不可能的 学校需要学生考学成绩", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700486083}, "7303577348836786944": {"comments": "这和作业什么关系", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700496621}, "7303774309175198483": {"comments": "建议签字熔断的孩子分成一个班，要写作业考大学的另分一个班。毕竟这两波孩子以后也没法玩到一起成为同学", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700542477}, "7303829977187025676": {"comments": "做得好，就应该这样", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700555442}, "7303867123096863507": {"comments": "太希望能推广了，天天不学习不写作业，让老师怎么办，敢问家长家长就觉得老师找茬，我闲的吗？又不是我孩子，父母都不觉得需要学习，我凭什么干涉人家？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700564088}, "7303888299184128808": {"comments": "我也是", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700569016}, "7304301551269921572": {"comments": "感觉熔断不是今天才有的。40年往前一直是自动熔断的，不想学的都主动回家干活了[愉快]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 4, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700665237}, "7304349678979253029": {"comments": "搞不清楚，平时考试不给分数，中考就要看分数。这是什么意思逻辑", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700676463}, "7304420318670914319": {"comments": "我们班就有这样的学生，作业写不完就不来了，校长也找我谈了好几次，说我不要要求太高了，不然都不来了。[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700692894}, "7304483573977285376": {"comments": "所以农民工的孩子大概率还是农民工[捂脸][捂脸][捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700707620}, "7304519045851579187": {"comments": "背离了教育的本质，教育不是把人变做工具。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700715875}, "7304698026315645737": {"comments": "投胎真是个技术活", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700757554}, "7304842635675058979": {"comments": "什么时候房贷也可以熔断", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700791219}, "7305027337786884914": {"comments": "为什么会有五五分流呢？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700834220}, "7305199370998678272": {"comments": "做完自己喜欢的科目，其他的科目都不写了？", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700874277}, "7305220588560483124": {"comments": "我觉得挺好的，教师布置作业面对的是全体的学生，熔断有利于家长根据自家孩子都实际情况去选择做什么作业", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700879215}, "7305267019820581643": {"comments": "作业熔断说明作业留的不合理 该拔高的没得到拔高 该巩固基础的没巩固基础", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1700890029}}, "controversy": 1, "crawl_time": 1701064896.2442088, "custom_verify": "", "enterprise_verify_reason": "", "forward_num": 1982, "is_modified": 1, "keywords": "双减政策", "like_num": 4798, "publish_time": 1699141417, "star_num": 1229, "title": "中小学实施“作业熔断”机制#教育问题值得深思 #社会热点 #双减政策落地", "url": "https://www.douyin.com/aweme/v1/play/?video_id=v0200fg10000cl3ddujc77ua1abkq6cg", "video_id": "7297756754153131273", "video_length": 177.800001}
{"author_follower": 11584, "author_like": 242448, "author_video": 92, "comment_num": 1780, "comments": {"7009618742384886540": {"comments": "减一点老师的检查才是王道。\n众所周知，现在的老师基本是都是做材料备查[暗中观察]哪有什么时间备课上课。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 727, "comments_reply": 3, "comments_time": 1632054045}, "7009683141267227423": {"comments": "托管费又出来了[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 902, "comments_reply": 23, "comments_time": 1632069045}, "7009896226506556200": {"comments": "听说2022年，中考又加了美育，是要去校外培训机构吗，条件不好的家庭怎么办", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 147, "comments_reply": 4, "comments_time": 1632118652}, "7009897572437541665": {"comments": "结果现在孩子更累，我儿子班上同学7点还要去上8点半的课外辅导班，学校是8点20上课，每周还要请一下迟到假。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 18, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1632118967}, "7009904514841707294": {"comments": "根本打不开那些课程", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 26, "comments_reply": 6, "comments_time": 1632120584}, "7009928229591171873": {"comments": "那些免费课小孩子根本不看的，家长陪着看都打瞌睡", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 34, "comments_reply": 3, "comments_time": 1632126105}, "7009956543991579422": {"comments": "表面减少了实际更多了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 2908, "comments_reply": 43, "comments_time": 1632132698}, "7010166761542763278": {"comments": "省钱，这是不可能的事。[捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 3460, "comments_reply": 14, "comments_time": 1632181642}, "7010190455124083460": {"comments": "如果网课有用，我又何必线下报培训班呢[捂脸][捂脸][捂脸]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 2028, "comments_reply": 21, "comments_time": 1632187158}, "7010217308577235724": {"comments": "呵呵，网上看，嗯，和看手机，电视有什么差别[微笑]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 84, "comments_reply": 6, "comments_time": 1632193411}, "7010221539165848359": {"comments": "某种程度上也为未来的工厂准备了很多不需要很高文化的职位候选人。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 126, "comments_reply": 2, "comments_time": 1632194396}, "7010355771850572547": {"comments": "说就说你写什么字", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 52, "comments_reply": 4, "comments_time": 1632225649}, "7010414955585700648": {"comments": "也就是说双减让有学识有知识的家庭的孩子更优秀。而家长知识不高的家庭，孩子更加难以优秀，从而两极分化的更严重。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 42, "comments_reply": 2, "comments_time": 1632239429}, "7010425967299117835": {"comments": "减负等于加正[惊呆]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 19, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1632241998}, "7010525853898261252": {"comments": "网课这东西，优秀学生用不上，差的学生，用不上。", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": true, "comments_like": 13, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1632265253}, "7025964840125055778": {"comments": "@Z. @盗版牙牙乐 笑死", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1635859917}, "7025988987408483113": {"comments": "@半兮 @辰儿 你看，义务教育阶段，没有高中啊[微笑]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1635865540}, "7025999788961284877": {"comments": "负负为正[泣不成声][泣不成声]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1635868058}, "7026773702726140702": {"comments": "这孩子晚自习的时间也多了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 2, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1636048273}, "7026966455821009671": {"comments": "@仙女犟 给你弟下视频", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1636093127}, "7027077546873946920": {"comments": "时间更少了，托管费多了，我们这边星期六都去学校托管了", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1636118989}, "7027291221651473187": {"comments": "@_ @会想起我吗 真的减了吗[尬笑]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 3, "comments_time": 1636168740}, "7028553632790446848": {"comments": "@是ʸᵒᵘ来晚了 @月 @不会再ᵃⁱ你啦 我们学校减了 耶~[胜利]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1636462667}, "7028927439200027405": {"comments": "@良知 [泣不成声][泣不成声][泣不成声]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1636549702}, "7029135865054233374": {"comments": "托管费比外面培训机构还要贵，又加重家长压力", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1636598232}, "7029933697407632161": {"comments": "好了好了，我知道了，赶紧删了。[泣不成声]", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1636783991}, "7030071845030871844": {"comments": "吃一餐14块😅", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 1, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1636816156}, "7030835819699159819": {"comments": "@🈚️🐟 [尬笑]第一个假的吧", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1636994038}, "7031355912020034342": {"comments": "啊？！双减是什么，我不知道", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 0, "comments_time": 1637115127}, "7031864655530967839": {"comments": "双剑开始，我的年纪也增大了，我的压力其实也大报了编程，练字儿，英语这个钱也没有减少每个人的看法，想法，还有实际行动都不一样", "comments_is_author_like": false, "comments_is_hot": false, "comments_like": 0, "comments_reply": 1, "comments_time": 1637233576}, "7031928290772927269": {"comments": "@琳琳睡不醒